3 Tutorial
**********

This chapter builds one agent from nothing, a property at a time.  Every
step was run, and the output shown after each is the text the buffer
actually held.  Nothing outside Emacs is needed: the scope stays on your
agenda files, so no ripgrep, no registry and no configuration is
involved.

